        },
        {
          "id": "1785760269875",
          "from": "mfmatrix",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-03T12:31:09.875Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-03T06:31:09-06:00",
          "text": "We're waiting for maintenance to come and create the recipes for the new product.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1785760961648",
          "from": "Grey Boscan",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-03T12:42:41.648Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-03T06:42:41-06:00",
          "text": "According to the spec, the HSC master case requires the Lot Code and Best If Used By date to be ink-jetted on both sides of the case. Frederick Peairs",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1785761659994",
          "from": "Frederick Peairs",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-03T12:54:19.994Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-03T06:54:19-06:00",
          "text": "Rose Smuin Chad Stone Troy Baxter good morning, on the MFM the Spec is requiring dates on both sides of the FG box, do you guys have one of the double printers we can barrow",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1785762399908",
          "from": "Troy Baxter",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-03T13:06:39.908Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-03T07:06:39-06:00",
          "text": "We have a set not being used at the moment, but you'd have to ask Curt or Justin.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1785762507463",
          "from": "Troy Baxter",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-03T13:08:27.463Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-03T07:08:27-06:00",
          "text": "The ones we have are on their own stands, so they are somewhat mobile and can be set up anywhere.  However, they do require air to operate, so where ever you plan to set them up would need easy access to compressed air.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        }
      ]
    },
